  # churning: the raw axis flaps every read — NO fixed point exists, yet the debounce holds the calm
  # committed NOMINAL. This is the von Foerster reification the sidecar exists to expose. residual 50%.
  # (Falsify: remove the flips≥half branch → an alternating tape misreads as 'converging', hiding the churn.)
  echk "churning (WATCH↔NOMINAL flap under committed NOMINAL)" "$(eigen_classify 'NOMINAL WATCH NOMINAL WATCH NOMINAL WATCH NOMINAL WATCH' NOMINAL)" "churning 50"
